Advanced Blacksmithing represents mastery of the forge beyond basic weapon
and armor repair. Warriors who dedicate themselves to the smith's art learn
techniques that allow them to work with exotic materials and perform more
complex repairs.

This skill extends the blacksmith's capabilities to include working with
crystalline materials, gemstones, and other substances that require special
techniques. Where basic blacksmithing handles iron and steel, advanced
practitioners can restore items crafted from rare and magical materials.

To use advanced blacksmithing, you need access to a proper forge and the
appropriate tools. The skill works automatically when repairing items that
require advanced techniques.

